*> Harness-only MQPUT: appends queue|correlid|payload| to $MQOUT.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MQPUT.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO DYNAMIC WS-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD OUT-FILE.
01 OUT-REC.
   05 O-QUEUE PIC X(48).
   05 FILLER PIC X VALUE '|'.
   05 O-CORREL PIC X(24).
   05 FILLER PIC X VALUE '|'.
   05 O-PAYLOAD PIC X(1000).
   05 FILLER PIC X VALUE '|'.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-PATH PIC X(256).
01 MQ-HANDLES EXTERNAL.
   05 MQ-HCOUNT PIC 9(2) BINARY.
   05 MQ-HNAME PIC X(48) OCCURS 10.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 L-HCONN PIC S9(9) BINARY.
01 L-HOBJ PIC S9(9) BINARY.
01 L-MD.
   05 L-FORMAT PIC X(8).
   05 L-CCSID PIC S9(9) BINARY.
   05 L-MSGID PIC X(24).
   05 L-CORRELID PIC X(24).
   05 L-REPLYTOQ PIC X(48).
01 L-PMO PIC X(4).
01 L-BUFLEN PIC S9(9) BINARY.
01 L-BUFFER PIC X(1000).
01 L-CC PIC S9(9) BINARY.
01 L-RC PIC S9(9) BINARY.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-HCONN L-HOBJ L-MD L-PMO L-BUFLEN L-BUFFER
                         L-CC L-RC.
    ACCEPT WS-PATH FROM ENVIRONMENT 'MQOUT'
    OPEN EXTEND OUT-FILE
    MOVE MQ-HNAME(L-HOBJ) TO O-QUEUE
    MOVE L-CORRELID TO O-CORREL
    MOVE L-BUFFER TO O-PAYLOAD
    MOVE '|' TO OUT-REC(49:1) OUT-REC(74:1) OUT-REC(1075:1)
    WRITE OUT-REC
    CLOSE OUT-FILE
    MOVE 0 TO L-CC L-RC
    GOBACK.
